; Test whether the command puts an object somewhere
;
; Compares the command id (#R$B6E7) with the five verbs of the table at #R$A20B:
; $0E drop in, $11 put in, $12 put on, $14 take out of, $2C throw through. These
; are the commands whose second object is a place for the first.
;
; O:F Z set when the command is one of them
@label=IsPlacingCommand
c$A1D0 PUSH HL
 $A1D1 PUSH BC
 $A1D2 LD B,$05
 $A1D4 LD HL,$A20B
 $A1D7 LD A,($B6E7)
*$A1DA CP (HL)
 $A1DB JR Z,$A1E0
 $A1DD INC HL
 $A1DE DJNZ $A1DA
*$A1E0 POP BC
 $A1E1 POP HL
 $A1E2 RET
